# A centred input forms two images at 3 L_pi / 8, with L_pi = 162.13 um from the two lowest modes of the body.
# Reference: equal outputs by symmetry; near the imaging length each carries almost half.
title 1x2 multimode interferometer 8 um wide at 0.9 of the imaging length
reference 2.8
grid dx=0.02 dz=0.25
window width=18 length=79.75
guide straight x=0 width=1.2 from=0 to=10
guide straight x=0 width=8 from=10 to=64.75
guide straight x=2 width=1.2 from=64.75 to=79.75
guide straight x=-2 width=1.2 from=64.75 to=79.75
launch mode x=0 width=1.2
monitor upper z=79.75 x=2 width=1.2
monitor lower z=79.75 x=-2 width=1.2
plane end z=79.75
expect power upper 0.198875398 2e-7
expect power lower 0.198875398 2e-7
expect total end 0.996475741 2e-7
expect centroid end 0.0000000 2e-6
expect radius end 5.8317856 2e-6
expect neff 2.632269826 2e-8
expect ratio upper lower 1.0 1e-4
